# Plan 010 — transactional host activation, tmpfs state.
#
# /run is tmpfs: after every reboot the package-transaction lock path is gone,
# and the preinst/postinst gates must fail closed (they cannot stat the lock).
# systemd-tmpfiles recreates the directory and an empty lock file at boot so
# the documented `flock --no-fork` apt wrapper works without manual host
# preparation. The lock file carries no state — only its inode is meaningful.
d /run/velnor 0750 root root - -
f /run/velnor/package-transaction.lock 0640 root root - -
